  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Do <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></semantics></math> không cùng phương nên ba véc-tơ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></semantics></math> không bằng nhau. <br>\n\t\t\tKhẳng định trên là sai.</li><li>Do vật được treo cân bằng nên tổng các véc-tơ biểu diễn các lực tác dụng lên vật bằng véc-tơ không, do đó ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>\n\t\t\tKhẳng định trên là đúng.</li><li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>\n\t\t\tKhẳng đinh trên là đúng</li><li><div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> lần lượt là các điểm sao cho <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\t\tDựng hình hộp <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>\n\t\t\t\tKhi đó áp dụng quy tắc hình hộp, ta có:\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t\tMặt khác, do các lực căng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> đôi một vuông góc và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> (N) nên hình hộp <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có ba cạnh <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> bằng nhau và đôi một vuông góc. Vì thế hình hộp đó là hình lập phương có độ dài cạnh bằng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra độ dài đường chéo <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> của hình lập phương đó bằng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>15</mn></semantics></math> (N).<br>\n\t\t\t\tVậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">(N)</mtext><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math>  <br>\n\t\t\t\tKhẳng định trên là sai.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/ddd2001eb58dc8b5e247f89c18b851ead72734a5f6919f82d51a279b22024e31.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div></li></ol>",
